":-59.6092},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"bridgetown_wv_harbour_lights","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.harbourlightsbarbados.com","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["harbourlights","bridgetown"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"By day this is a beach-club for cruise passengers and others who don't have a hotel beach. They also have snorkelling trips with the turtles. On W & Th evenings there's a dinner show with steel bands and all the rum you can handle. And Friday evenings it's a nightclub.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Bridgetown"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}